        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Venture into Jozani Chwaka Bay National Park, Zanzibar's only national park. Walk guided forest trails to see the endangered rare red colobus monkey (endemic to Zanzibar), plus blue monkeys, bushbabies, and over 200 bird species.</p>
      </section>
