      <li>Blue Sykes monkey, lesser bushbaby, and birdwatching opportunities</li>
      <li>Visit the visitor center and turtle sanctuary at the park entrance</li>
      <li>Can combine with Kuza Cave to the south or The Rock Restaurant</li>
        </ul>
